# Copy this to `.env` in this same directory (infrastructure/deployment/
# hetzner/) on the Hetzner VM and fill in real values. docker compose
# reads .env automatically from the directory it's invoked from — never
# commit the real .env (it's covered by the repo's root .gitignore
# pattern for .env; double-check with `git status` before any commit
# from this directory regardless).
#
# See the repo root's .env.example / packages/configuration/src/secrets.ts
# for what every one of these actually controls server-side.

# ── Database — generate real random values, e.g. `openssl rand -base64 24` ──
POSTGRES_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
POSTGRES_APP_PASSWORD=

# ── HTTP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://infini-cus.com,https://www.infini-cus.com

# ── Email (optional — unset means verification emails are logged, not
# sent; never blocks registration) ──────────────────────────────────
RESEND_API_KEY=
EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=INFINICUS <noreply@infini-cus.com>
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_URL_BASE=https://infini-cus.com/verify-email

# ── AI Decisions (optional — unset means recommendations fall back to a
# deterministic threshold-based generator; never blocks) ────────────
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── Observability ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=info

# ── Event worker (OPTIONAL - the worker is built but NOT deployed or enabled by default) ─────────────────
# Only needed when the `event-worker` compose profile (infrastructure/deployment/event-worker/) is deliberately started. Leave commented out
# otherwise. These are the names the worker code reads (packages/event-worker); thresholds are owner-set deployment values, not code defaults.
# See infrastructure/deployment/event-worker/README.md - the worker also needs a SEPARATE read-only discovery role, and nothing it does has any
# effect until a per-business governed activation exists. Keep INFINICUS_EXECUTION_KILL_SWITCH engaged until activation is separately authorised.
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_DISCOVERY_DATABASE_URL=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_ID=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_ACTOR_USER_ID=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_INTAKE_STATUS_MAX_AGE_MS=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_EXECUTION_STATUS_MAX_AGE_MS=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_CLAIM_TIMEOUT_MS=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_BATCH_SIZE=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_MAX_SCOPES_PER_CYCLE=
# INFINICUS_EVENT_WORKER_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=
# INFINICUS_EXECUTION_KILL_SWITCH=
